Third-party software
--------------------
The Lean build depends on Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4,
Apache License 2.0) and the packages it pins, as recorded in lake-manifest.json.
They are fetched at build time, are not redistributed in this repository, and
retain their own licenses. The CI tooling's Python dependencies are listed in
requirements/ci/*.txt and likewise retain their own licenses.
